  "body": [
    "Inicio",
    "Revista Thread",
    "Tu guía sobre las últimas innovaciones en datos e inteligencia artificial",
    "Descarga Thread ahora",
    "Thread es tu guía hacia el futuro: diseñada para ir al grano con insights estratégicos y accionables sobre datos, inteligencia artificial y tecnología. Amplificando voces expertas de todo el mundo, nuestra revista ofrece perspectivas únicas sobre la transformación empresarial. Cada edición destaca retos y oportunidades clave, analizados desde la innovación en la experiencia, para inspirar tus próximos pasos.",
    "The Experience Loop",
    "¡Descarga Thread ya!",
    "GenAI’s next frontier: Scaling for lasting impact",
    "Discover practical tips for maximizing GenAI’s potential through proprietary data, smart governance and human-AI collaboration.",
    "GenAI adoption is accelerating, but it’s not a one-size-fits-all solution. Learn how to recognize when GenAI is not the answer.",
    "Find out how leading brands are using GenAI as a growth engine and making proprietary data a competitive advantage.",
    "Stay ahead with our AI glossary. Learn essential terms like GPT, RAG and knowledge graph to understand how they’re shaping the future of business.",
    "Predictions on personalization, efficiency and industry-wide transformation as enterprises harness AI for growth and deeper connections.",
    "Discover how AI in UX design is transforming expectations and opening the door to frictionless, intuitive experiences.",
    "Discover how enterprises can set the standard for responsible AI, balancing innovation with privacy, fairness and sustainability.",
    "Suscríbete ahora y sé de los primeros en acceder a historias inspiradoras sobre datos e IA, novedades sobre temas clave y consejos prácticos para impulsar la transformación digital."
